  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9159c645-12b5-5155-a493-ea9e75f74135" activityNameId="94e65cd3-7124-5b59-a03d-3650a8ebc433" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road
Inventory for an average swiss road (highway, cantonal and municipial). All data is referred to meter*year. Life time of road is assumed to be 100 yrs. For the 3 layers of a road, different life spans are assumed. In addition, environmental interventions due to tunnel and bridge construction have been taken into account, according to the share of tunnels in the Swiss road network.;
UUID: da85c1ba-b1b3-3e9f-817b-d5c1430195ae
The inventory includes processes for the supply of used materials such as gravel, bitumen and concrete.  NMVOC emissions from bitumen and particle emissions due to construction are included. Also transport of materials to the constructions site has been taken into account.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss state of the art technology
Time period: Road lenght is based on current statistical data (2000). The material consumption represents a situation in the early 1990ties.
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics and literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_da85c1ba-b1b3-3e9f-817b-d5c1430195ae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
